{"title":"Spirit of Math Contest","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Spirit of Math Contest</b> (also known as the <b>International Spirit of Math Contest</b>) is an annual <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a> for students in grades 1 through 8, organized by Spirit of Math.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Participation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Participation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Format\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Format</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Awards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Awards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Participation\">Participation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spirit_of_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Participation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of the 2027 edition, the contest is offered in 47 countries and territories. Students are not required to be enrolled in a Spirit of Math program to take part; the contest is open to all students in the eligible grades.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Format\">Format</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spirit_of_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Format\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The contest is written during a designated annual window; for the 2027 edition the window is January 4 – April 5, 2027. The number of questions and the time limit vary by grade. Calculators are not permitted, and there is no penalty for incorrect answers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Awards\">Awards</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spirit_of_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Awards\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Students are recognized in score-based award bands, and high-scoring students are named to an Honour Roll. Every participant receives a certificate of participation. Top performers may qualify for the Global Round, held in Toronto.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spirit_of_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: External links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.spiritofmathcontest.com\">Official website</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110935\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 13/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37761:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110935 and revision id 291880. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}